# `reporting/posters/` — Conference posters

## Authority

See the root [`README.md`](../../README.md), reporting
[`README.md`](../README.md), and [`AGENTS.md`](../AGENTS.md).

Use one artifact folder per poster, conventionally `YYYY-MM-venue/`. Mutable
source lives in the artifact folder. Use light/print data figures from
`results/figures/light/` and authored schematics from `assets/figures/`; verify
legibility at the intended physical dimensions.

When a PDF is sent to a printer or conference, create
`deliveries/<YYYY-MM-DD>-printer-final/` (or another precise milestone) with the
exact PDF, exact figures, and `delivery.yaml`. That directory is immutable; a
later venue or correction gets a new artifact/delivery. See
[`../DELIVERIES.md`](../DELIVERIES.md).
